graph TD
    User["👤 User"] -->|"Asks Claude to<br/>create interactive<br/>visualization"| Claude["🤖 Claude<br/>(Conversation)"]
    
    Claude -->|"Analyzes request<br/>Generates HTML/CSS/JS<br/>Calls visualize tool"| MCPClient["MCP Client<br/>(Claude-side)"]
    
    MCPClient -->|"Tool: visualize:show_widget<br/>Param: widget_code<br/>(HTML string)"| MCPServer["MCP Server<br/>(Imagine Visual<br/>Creation Suite)"]
    
    MCPServer -->|"Register resource URI<br/>Host caches widget_code"| Host["🎨 Host UI<br/>(Claude Chat)"]
    
    Host -->|"Parse HTML<br/>Inject CSS vars<br/>Render DOM<br/>Attach event handlers"| Browser["🌐 Browser DOM"]
    
    Browser -->|"Display interactive<br/>widget to user"| User
    
    User -->|"Interact:<br/>Sliders, buttons,<br/>form inputs"| Browser
    
    Browser -->|"JavaScript event handlers<br/>run client-side<br/>DOM updates<br/>Chart re-renders<br/>ZERO API calls"| Browser
    
    Browser -->|"Display results<br/>Real-time calculations"| User
    
    subgraph "Token Cost Analysis"
        A["Initial: ~2,500 tokens<br/>Widget generation & delivery"]
        B["Per interaction: 0 tokens<br/>Client-side JavaScript"]
        C["Update: ~3,200 tokens<br/>Regenerate full widget"]
    end
    
    style Claude fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style MCPServer fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Host fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style Browser fill:#fbb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style A fill:#eee
    style B fill:#eee
    style C fill:#eee
